-The push-driven channels (alpha/beta/rc) use a monotonic per-channel counter (`-alpha.1`, `-alpha.2`, …). The cron channels use `YYYYMMDD` so the tag is self-documenting. Both shapes are derived automatically — you don't pick the number.
